      <h2>About Kizimkazi Dive &amp; Dolphin</h2>
      <p>Kizimkazi Dive &amp; Dolphin on Zanzibar&#x27;s south coast uniquely combines PADI diving services with ethical dolphin watching tours following strict no-chase, no-feed, no-touch protocols. Early morning dolphin tours observe wild bottlenose dolphins in their natural habitat, followed by guided dives to Menai Bay reefs and coral gardens. PADI courses, marine biology briefings, and community-based conservation model supporting local fishers. Combine diving and dolphins for a full marine day.</p>

